            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store the string <code>\"low\"</code> in a variable named <code>sign_ups</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sign_ups = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"low\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>sign_ups</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"low\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
