            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a <code>save_file</code> variable and store <code>False</code> in it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"save_file = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;True&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>save_file</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store the value <code>False</code> in a variable named <code>save_file</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"save_file = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;True&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;False&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>save_file</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>"
